[gd_scene format=3]

; The Voice Recognition Unit's 1.5 m cord and the NUS-021 microphone on the end
; of it. The microphone's long axis is Z, the grille at -Z and the cord leaving
; the flat rear end at +Z; every cylinder here is rotated Y -> Z.
;
; Sizes are estimated from photographs -- no dimensioned drawing was found.

